Smash your psiblades into the ground, creating a tide of crystallized leaves circling you in a radius of 3 for 7 turns.

All foes hit by the leaves will start bleeding for [25, 32, 37, 41, 45 (TL1-5; MP 100)] per turn (cumulative).

All allies hit will be covered in leaves, granting them [23%, 28%, 32%, 35%, 38% (TL1-5; MP 100)] chance to completely avoid any damaging attack.

Damage and avoidance will increase with your Mindpower and Mindstar power (requires two mindstars, multiplier 1.00).
